  "history": {
    "claims": [
      {
        "text": "In a Ren Zu telling, Love Gu says it cannot force others to love, but Ren Zu captures feathermen and digs out their hearts to collide them with his own. No heart sparks love, and as Love Gu warns that forcing love only creates hatred, hatred Gu appears and makes all of the feathermen feel hatred.",
        "chapters": [
          1230
        ],
        "certainty": "canon",
        "confidence": "B",
        "verification": "citation_unchecked",
        "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
        "section": "intro",
        "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
        "mentions": [
          "char_ren_zu",
          "gu_love_gu"
        ]
      },
      {
        "text": "Red Heart Traveler detects Qing Chou’s vital Gu as rank eight hatred Gu and confirms it is the one recorded in The Legends of Ren Zu.",
        "chapters": [
          2019
        ],
        "certainty": "canon",
        "confidence": "B",
        "verification": "citation_unchecked",
        "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
        "section": "vital-gu",
        "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
        "mentions": [
          "char_red_heart_traveler",
          "char_qing_chou",
          "sys_vital_gu",
          "sys_the_legends_of_ren_zu"
        ]
      },
      {
        "text": "A later Legends of Ren Zu stretch has Hatred Gu look similar to love Gu on the surface while naming itself Hatred Gu. It gnaws a heart to change that heart into a heart of hatred. When crushed it resurrects from the blood and grows larger, and it says hatred cannot be killed and that vengeance only breeds more hatred. It is like a curved blade without a handle. Drawn by lightning Gu’s anger, hatred Gu lends lightning Gu its own strength, and lightning Gu breaks the heavenly wind qi wall and shatters the whole of immemorial blue heaven.",
        "chapters": [
          2021
        ],
        "certainty": "canon",
        "confidence": "B",
        "verification": "citation_unchecked",
        "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
        "section": "second-ren-zu-telling",
        "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
        "mentions": [
          "gu_lightning_gu"
        ]
      },
      {
        "text": "Reading this, Fang Yuan wonders whether hatred Gu and lightning Gu together could counter heaven path, and notes that the combination will not work without hatred Gu.",
        "chapters": [
          2022
        ],
        "certainty": "canon",
        "confidence": "B",
        "verification": "citation_unchecked",
        "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
        "section": "second-ren-zu-telling",
        "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
        "mentions": [
          "char_fang_yuan"
        ]
      },
      {
        "text": "Qing Chou uses hatred Gu to break free of a dream realm, and someone in the battle cries that The Legends of Ren Zu has a vague line that hatred has no dreams. Hatred Gu is still progressing towards rank nine in this battle, and Fang Yuan wonders whether, rather than hatred having no dreams, the dream realm was too small to stand against rank nine hatred Gu.",
        "chapters": [
          2033
        ],
        "certainty": "canon",
        "confidence": "B",
        "verification": "citation_unchecked",
        "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
        "section": "breaking-free-of-a-dream-realm",
        "text_origin": "source_excerpt"
      },
      {
        "text": "Lu Wei Yin later states Qing Chou’s core is hatred Gu formed through Divine Bean Palace under Genesis Lotus Immortal Venerable’s plot. Genesis Lotus’s plan was for Qing Chou to hold rank nine hatred Gu in the fate war. Inside Divine Bean Palace, Qing Chou had been raising hatred Gu and growing stronger until Fang Yuan helped Fang clan drive it away, which disrupted that process.",
        "chapters": [
          2083
        ],
        "certainty": "canon",
        "confidence": "B",
        "verification": "citation_unchecked",
        "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
        "section": "genesis-lotuss-plot",
        "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
        "mentions": [
          "char_lu_wei_yin",
          "char_genesis_lotus_immortal_venerable",
          "fac_fang_clan"
        ]
      },
      {
        "text": "Lu Wei Yin says the aura of rank nine hatred Gu has completely vanished and seems destroyed, though he cannot be certain whether Qing Chou is dead or alive.",
        "chapters": [
          2084
        ],
        "certainty": "canon",
        "confidence": "B",
        "verification": "citation_unchecked",
        "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
        "section": "genesis-lotuss-plot",
        "text_origin": "source_excerpt"
      },
      {
        "text": "Hatred Gu is counted among history’s few rank nine Immortal Gu, one that cost Genesis Lotus Immortal Venerable hundreds of thousands of years of scheming before he succeeded.",
        "chapters": [
          2099
        ],
        "certainty": "canon",
        "confidence": "B",
        "verification": "citation_unchecked",
        "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
        "section": "genesis-lotuss-plot",
        "text_origin": "source_excerpt"
      }
    ]
  },
